          "page_index": 88,
          "block_type": "text",
          "text": "The Mandelbrot Set is a strange shape, and the closer you look, the stranger it becomes. It's been called the thumbprint of God and the Creator's calling card - clear evidence of a deep underlying harmony and unity in nature."
        },
        {
          "node_id": "6d4a36ac-70fd-55e0-9368-42b37346d83b",
          "page_index": 88,
          "block_type": "text",
          "text": "The Mandelbrot Set looks very complicated, and yet it is generated by a very simple rule:"
        }
